      "value": "I noticed the same thing. It kinda ruins the immersion. Sure its nice to include people that are using the Quest, but the Game was mainly made for desktop VR users. Don't just lower the quality for everyone just so it's more performant for mobile VR systems.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
