      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi TheHeimZocker,\n\nThanks for the post! A few questions\n\n1. Are you on Desktop, Oculus, Vive or something else?\n2. What world were you in and how many players were there?\n3. Do you see this issue with just you and one other player in a room?\n\nIf it's not too much trouble, a video of what you are seeing would be super helpful!\n\nIt's possible this is a performance change that trades player smoothness for performance when you are hitting low frame rate. \n\nBest,\n\nGraham",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
